  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated landscape management to reduce land degradation and enhance community resilience in Angola?s Miombo-Mopane dry forests (FSP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To initiate a transformational shift towards a sustainable and integrated management of multi-use dryland landscapes of the Miombo and Mopane ecoregions of Angola (Okavango and Cunene river basins) following Land Degradation Neutrality (LDN) principles.</narrative>
  </description>
